# Build context for Dockerfile.admin-api / Dockerfile.tech-api is this directory.
# Nothing here may depend on the builder's working tree:
#  - .env files would be baked into image layers and survive any runtime override
#  - a copied clicks-shared/node_modules would shadow the single mongoose instance
#    that NODE_PATH resolves to, reintroducing the split-mongoose buffering bug
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.log
.git
